  "zh": "# AI技术突破与产业动态同步，安全议题引关注\n## AI科技\n- **OpenAI 722 篇数学论文**：展示大模型在基础科学上的深度应用，预示AI将加速数学研究。\n- **Mistral Large 4 发布**：Mistral 推出新一代大模型，性能提升明显，竞争格局再添变数。\n## 产业与商业\n- **华为涨价 余承东称不得不涨价**：华为面临成本压力宣布涨价，反映供应链与研发投入的双重挑战。\n- **AI 应届博士年薪百万被抢**：顶尖人才待遇飙升，显示AI领域人才争夺战已白热化。\n## 社会与安全\n- **缅北电诈窝点距边境200米**：电诈据点触及边境凸显跨境犯罪的严峻形势，需加强国际合作打击。\n- **Utah 许 AI 开药无医生**：美国首例让AI独立开药的法规引发伦理与安全争议，医疗监管将面临新考验。\n## 国际与政策\n- **韩国称 AI 代理被用于黑客攻击银行**：韩国警告AI被用于金融攻击，提醒全球加强AI安全防护与监管。\n- **2026 诺贝尔物理奖**：奖项表彰中微子天文台IceCube的贡献，彰显基础科学与大数据交叉的重要性。",
  "en": "# AI breakthroughs and industry shifts coincide as safety concerns rise\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI 722 math papers**: Shows LLMs are becoming collaborators in pure math, potentially accelerating theorem proving.\n- **Mistral Large 4 release**: Mistral claims its new model outperforms peers in multilingual reasoning, shaking up the LLM landscape.\n## Industry\n- **Huawei price increase**: Huawei cites chip costs and R&D to justify price hikes, highlighting squeezed margins in premium smartphones.\n- **AI PhD graduate salary surge**: Soaring offers for fresh AI doctorates reveal fierce talent wars across tech giants.\n## Society\n- **Myanmar scam hub near border**: The proximity of fraud compounds to the frontier exposes the stealth of cross‑border crime networks.\n- **Utah AI prescribing law**: Utah’s statute letting AI prescribe drugs without physician oversight sets a precedent, raising safety and ethics concerns.\n## International\n- **South Korea AI bank hack**: Seoul warns that AI agents are being used to breach banks, urging stronger AI security defenses globally.\n- **2026 Nobel Physics Prize**: The award honors IceCube’s neutrino observations, underscoring the fusion of big data with fundamental physics."
}